  "version": "0.41",
  "about": "The closed list of primary-tier sources for the macro, expectations and notice stages (C2). A page counts only if its URL is on one of an institution's domains; a citation counts only if it starts with one of that institution's aliases. Edit this file between runs, never during one.",
